{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckbox\/init(isOn:accessibilityLabel:isError:isReadOnly:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckbox\/init(isOn:accessibilityLabel:tableName:bundle:isError:isReadOnly:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckbox\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckbox\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckbox\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOCheckbox","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Controls"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"Indicator-states","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Indicator states"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This checkbox indicator has two available states:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"selected","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": the checkbox is filled with a tick, the user has made the action to select the checkbox","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"unselected","type":"text"}]},{"text":": the checkbox is empty, does not contain a tick, the user has made the action to unselect or did not select yet the checkbox","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you need to use a tri-state checkbox instead, refer to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxIndeterminate","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Particular-cases","text":"Particular cases","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckbox"},{"type":"text","text":" can be related to an error situation, for example troubles for a form librairies."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A dedicated look-and-feel is implemented for that if the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isError"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is risen."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note also the component must be instanciated with a string parameter used as accessibility label.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It is a good pratice (at least) to define a label for a component without text for accessibility reasons. This label will be vocalized by ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Voice Over"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The vocalization tool will also use, after the label, a description of the component (if disabled, if error context), and a fake trait for checkbox.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"No accessibility identifier is defined in MISO side as this value remains in the users hands.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Cases-forbidden-by-design","text":"Cases forbidden by design","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inl